{
  "id": 100,
  "nameArabic": "العاديات",
  "nameTransliteration": "Al-Aadiyaat",
  "nameEnglish": "The Chargers",
  "ayahCount": 11,
  "revelationType": "Meccan",
  "revelationOrder": 14,
  "rukus": 1,
  "startAyahGlobal": 6146,
  "verses": [
    {
      "ayah": 1,
      "arabic": "بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ وَٱلْعَٰدِيَٰتِ ضَبْحًا",
      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "text": "By the racers, panting,",
          "translator": "Saheeh International",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        },
        "ur": {
          "text": "ان سرپٹ دوڑنے والے گھوڑوں کی قسم جو ہانپ اٹھتےہیں",
          "translator": "Fateh Muhammad Jalandhry (فتح محمد جالندھری)",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "ayah": 2,
      "arabic": "فَٱلْمُورِيَٰتِ قَدْحًا",
      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "text": "And the producers of sparks [when] striking",
          "translator": "Saheeh International",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        },
        "ur": {
          "text": "پھر (پتھروں پر نعل) مار کر آگ نکالتے ہیں",
          "translator": "Fateh Muhammad Jalandhry (فتح محمد جالندھری)",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "ayah": 3,
      "arabic": "فَٱلْمُغِيرَٰتِ صُبْحًا",
      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "text": "And the chargers at dawn,",
          "translator": "Saheeh International",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        },
        "ur": {
          "text": "پھر صبح کو چھاپہ مارتے ہیں",
          "translator": "Fateh Muhammad Jalandhry (فتح محمد جالندھری)",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "ayah": 4,
      "arabic": "فَأَثَرْنَ بِهِۦ نَقْعًا",
      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "text": "Stirring up thereby [clouds of] dust,",
          "translator": "Saheeh International",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        },
        "ur": {
          "text": "پھر اس میں گرد اٹھاتے ہیں",
          "translator": "Fateh Muhammad Jalandhry (فتح محمد جالندھری)",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "ayah": 5,
      "arabic": "فَوَسَطْنَ بِهِۦ جَمْعًا",
      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "text": "Arriving thereby in the center collectively,",
          "translator": "Saheeh International",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        },
        "ur": {
          "text": "پھر اس وقت دشمن کی فوج میں جا گھستے ہیں",
          "translator": "Fateh Muhammad Jalandhry (فتح محمد جالندھری)",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "ayah": 6,
      "arabic": "إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ لِرَبِّهِۦ لَكَنُودٌ",
      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "text": "Indeed mankind, to his Lord, is ungrateful.",
          "translator": "Saheeh International",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        },
        "ur": {
          "text": "کہ انسان اپنے پروردگار کا احسان ناشناس (اور ناشکرا) ہے",
          "translator": "Fateh Muhammad Jalandhry (فتح محمد جالندھری)",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "ayah": 7,
      "arabic": "وَإِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ ذَٰلِكَ لَشَهِيدٌ",
      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "text": "And indeed, he is to that a witness.",
          "translator": "Saheeh International",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        },
        "ur": {
          "text": "اور وہ اس سے آگاہ بھی ہے",
          "translator": "Fateh Muhammad Jalandhry (فتح محمد جالندھری)",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "ayah": 8,
      "arabic": "وَإِنَّهُۥ لِحُبِّ ٱلْخَيْرِ لَشَدِيدٌ",
      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "text": "And indeed he is, in love of wealth, intense.",
          "translator": "Saheeh International",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        },
        "ur": {
          "text": "وہ تو مال سے سخت محبت کرنے والا ہے",
          "translator": "Fateh Muhammad Jalandhry (فتح محمد جالندھری)",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "ayah": 9,
      "arabic": "أَفَلَا يَعْلَمُ إِذَا بُعْثِرَ مَا فِى ٱلْقُبُورِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "text": "But does he not know that when the contents of the graves are scattered",
          "translator": "Saheeh International",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        },
        "ur": {
          "text": "کیا وہ اس وقت کو نہیں جانتا کہ جو (مردے) قبروں میں ہیں وہ باہر نکال لیے جائیں گے",
          "translator": "Fateh Muhammad Jalandhry (فتح محمد جالندھری)",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "ayah": 10,
      "arabic": "وَحُصِّلَ مَا فِى ٱلصُّدُورِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "text": "And that within the breasts is obtained,",
          "translator": "Saheeh International",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        },
        "ur": {
          "text": "اور جو (بھید) دلوں میں ہیں وہ ظاہر کر دیئے جائیں گے",
          "translator": "Fateh Muhammad Jalandhry (فتح محمد جالندھری)",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "ayah": 11,
      "arabic": "إِنَّ رَبَّهُم بِهِمْ يَوْمَئِذٍ لَّخَبِيرٌۢ",
      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "text": "Indeed, their Lord with them, that Day, is [fully] Acquainted.",
          "translator": "Saheeh International",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        },
        "ur": {
          "text": "بےشک ان کا پروردگار اس روز ان سے خوب واقف ہوگا",
          "translator": "Fateh Muhammad Jalandhry (فتح محمد جالندھری)",
          "source": "Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}